VISUAL: A dark, close-up shot of a drone propeller. The Antigravity A1 drone, Vision goggles, and Grip controller are shown with the "ANTIGRAVITY A1" logo.
AUDIO: 'Welcome to the world of Antigravity. What you‘re about to see is just the beginning. Meet Antigravity A1. The world\'s first 360 drone.¹'

[00:12] [scene:hardware]
VISUAL: A person wearing the Antigravity Vision goggles is shown.
AUDIO: 'Exceptionally lightweight. With the immersive Vision goggles and intuitive Grip controller flying becomes instinct.'

[00:25] [scene:demo]
VISUAL: Footage captured by the Antigravity A1 drone, showing a road in a desert landscape. An animated representation of the Antigravity A1 capturing 360-degree footage.
AUDIO: 'The sky becomes your playground. Antigravity A1 captures'

[00:37] [scene:demo]
VISUAL: Drone footage looking down on a bridge.
AUDIO: 'everything around it. The dual-lens setup mounted below and above the fuselage completely erases the drone. Letting you capture and relive every detail'

[00:49] [scene:hardware]
VISUAL: A person wearing the Vision goggles and holding the Grip controller.
AUDIO: 'in crystal-clear 8K. Drones are no longer just tools for content creation. Immerse yourself in 360 degrees with the Vision goggles.'

[01:02] [scene:text_overlay]
VISUAL: "IMMERSIVE FLIGHT EXPERIENCE" text over drone footage of a tropical island. A close-up of a hand holding the Antigravity Grip controller.
AUDIO: 'Look freely in any direction as if you\'re right there. You’re not piloting a drone... You\'re flying. No piloting skills?'

[01:14] [scene:demo]
VISUAL: Drone footage looking down on a city.
AUDIO: 'No problem. Point in any direction you want to go and A1 will fly there. Point up, and feel the rush as you soar into the sky. Controlling A1 feels natural.'

[01:28] [scene:demo]
VISUAL: Fast-paced drone footage flying through a city. Drone footage following a car on a wet surface.
AUDIO: 'Intuitive. Just point and go. Your will is its flight path. The payload detection system'

[01:46] [scene:text_overlay]
VISUAL: "THRILLS FOR ALL" text with a man and a child. A split screen comparing "TRADITIONAL DRONE" footage with "ANTIGRAVITY A1" footage of a red car.
AUDIO: 'triggers immediate landing if extra payload is detected. Share the flying experience through the unique front screen. Traditional drones force you to nail'

[02:00] [scene:comparison]
VISUAL: A split screen comparing "TRADITIONAL DRONE" footage with "ANTIGRAVITY A1" footage of a landscape.
AUDIO: 'the perfect shot mid-flight. Or lose it forever. With Antigravity A1 you\'ll never miss a shot. Every angle is yours. Tell endless stories with just one take.'

[02:12] [scene:demo]
VISUAL: Drone footage flying over a beach and ocean.
AUDIO: 'Let your creativity run wild. Bend reality. Warp perspectives. Your sky.'

[02:24] [scene:text_overlay]
VISUAL: "DYNAMIC REFRAMING" text over drone footage flying under a structure. Drone footage flying over a beach and ocean with a blurred effect.
AUDIO: 'Your rules. This is not just a drone.'

[02:40] [scene:outro]
VISUAL: The Antigravity logo on a black background. Text "Visit antigravity.tech for more." and a "SUBSCRIBE" button.
